# ForPost whitelist configuration
# Each line is a command prefix that is allowed in whitelist mode.
# Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# The command must START WITH one of these prefixes to be allowed.
#
# whitelist runs as the unprivileged RESTRICTED_COMMAND_USER (no docker group),
# so ONLY git/gh belong here - docker ops (restart, compose up/down, logs) need
# the socket and therefore run in full-access.

git pull
git fetch
git status
git log

# gh read-only (view PRs / repos / issues) - safe in whitelist mode.
# Write actions (gh repo create, gh pr merge, ...) stay full-access only.
gh pr list
gh pr view
gh pr diff
gh pr status
gh pr checks
gh repo view
gh issue list
gh issue view
